# Pin the npm registry for `bun install` invocations in this project,
# including the one `apx frontend build` runs in a sandboxed env that
# doesn't inherit `~/.npmrc`.
#
# We pin the Databricks-internal mirror here intentionally — it's what
# every developer on the Databricks network can reach, and CI rewrites
# this URL to `registry.npmjs.org` in the workflow before installing
# (see .github/workflows/ci.yml `Normalise bun.lock registry URLs for CI`).
#
# If you're a contributor outside the Databricks network and this URL
# is unreachable, override locally with:
#   export BUN_CONFIG_REGISTRY=https://registry.npmjs.org/
# Don't edit this file unless you also update the CI normalisation.
registry=https://npm-proxy.dev.databricks.com/
